[19.096279, "o", "## Decisions in force (1)\r\n\r\nEach was accepted, and none of them superseded. For the argument behind one, ask\r\n`read_record` for its id.\r\nEach line ends with the day it was accepted and whether an agent or a person accepted it.\r\nThe identity is mnid:4289b6a3, unless a line names another.\r\n0 of them were accepted by an agent and 1 by a person.\r\n\r\nNo other decision recorded here is awaiting a judgement.\r\n\r\n- **ADR-1: Keep money as integer cents** · `01a1f682-8eee-7000-9036-392fb656f4ca` · 2026-11-20 · person\r\n"]
[21.29856, "o", "\u001b[2m# and what the record can prove about itself: no key, no network\u001b[0m\r\n"]
